    "body": "Oh, you mean for empty lines? Yeah, I tend to prefer when empty lines keep the same indentation level as their context. As my text editor is set to display invisible characters, it make the structure stand out a bit more. I'm not very consistent about it, however.\n\nIf that's an issue for some, I'll just stop doing it. Do feel free to tap me on the shoulder if you see more of it in the future, though.\n",
